        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDLLEVER, Replacement Lever for Storm Door Latch Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a replacement lever for the <a href=\"/products/storm-door-latch-set-solid-brass-deltana-sdls480\">DEL-SDLS480 Screen and Storm Door Latch Set</a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDLLEVER-specifications.gif?v=1704442284\" width=\"571\" height=\"193\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SDLLEVER Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the SDLLEVER Screen Door Replacement Lever for Deltana SDLS480:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDLLEVER-specifications.pdf?v=1704262348\"><b>Deltana SDLLEVER Dimensions (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Check Your Hardware:</b> This work for the <a href=\"/products/storm-door-latch-set-solid-brass-deltana-sdls480\">DEL-SDLS480 Screen and Storm Door Latch Set</a> manufactured by Deltana. If you are not sure if your storm door latch set was manufactured by Deltana, do NOT order this as they may not work properly.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> <b>No Returns</b>\r\n</p>",
